[?2004l[?2004h>         "answer": "Lopinavir and ritonavir oral solution must be taken with food. It can be administered by feeding tube; however, polyurethane feeding tubes are not recommended due to potential incompatibility. Compatible feeding tubes include silicone and polyvinyl chloride (PVC) feeding tubes. For pediatric patients, the dose should be administered using the calibrated cup (supplied) or oral dosing syringe.",
